id: P-add-mcp-tool
name: Add a new MCP tool
description: Create a new MCP tool with its loader, register in index.ts, and wire up dispatch
trigger:
  - add tool
  - new mcp tool
  - create tool
  - add mcp tool
  - new paradigm tool
tags:
  - mcp
  - tools
  - backend
symbols:
  - '#protocol-tools'
  - '#lore-tools'
exemplar: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/tools/lore.ts
steps:
  - action: create
    target: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/utils/{name}-loader.ts
    template_from: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/utils/lore-loader.ts
    notes: Define types, CRUD functions, directory constants. Types duplicated in loader to avoid cross-package deps.
  - action: create
    target: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/tools/{name}.ts
    template_from: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/tools/lore.ts
    notes: Export getXxxToolsList() and handleXxxTool(). Each tool has name, description, inputSchema, annotations. Handler is a switch statement returning { text, handled }.
  - action: modify
    target: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/tools/index.ts
    reference: imports section (line ~42)
    notes: 'Add: import { getXxxToolsList, handleXxxTool } from ''./xxx.js'';'
  - action: modify
    target: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/tools/index.ts
    reference: tools array spread (near ...getPersonaToolsList())
    notes: 'Add: ...getXxxToolsList(),'
  - action: modify
    target: packages/paradigm-mcp/src/tools/index.ts
    reference: dispatch section (before 'Try reindex tool')
    notes: 'Add startsWith handler block: if (name.startsWith(''paradigm_xxx_'')) { ... }'
  - action: verify
    notes: 'Run: cd packages/paradigm-mcp && npm run build'
  - action: verify
    notes: 'Run: cd packages/paradigm && npm run build'
recorded_from: L-2026-03-01-protocols-impl
recorded_at: '2026-03-01T10:00:00Z'
last_verified: '2026-03-01T10:00:00Z'
